sentences.text:
It has been submitted on behalf of the appellant that :-
(i) the appellant has been falsely implicated in the present case;
(ii) the first information report was initially registered u/s 354, 506 I.P.C. and Section 3(1)? and 3(1)? of S.C./S.T. (P.A.) Act.

On the basis of statement of victim u/s 161 Cr.P.C. recorded 21 days after the occurrence on 16.09.2022, Section 376 I.P.C. was added to the Case Crime Number;
(iii) co-accused, Jeeshan, has already been enlarged on bail by a coordinate Bench of this Court vide order dated 06.02.2023 passed in Criminal Misc. Bail Application No.
56457 of 2022;
(iv) in the medical examination report of victim, it is mentioned by the Medical Officer that she informed her that sexual relationship by the appellant-accused was established with her consent;
(v) the appellant is in jail since 29.09.2022 and has no criminal history to his credit.

